            <img
              src="https://ik.imagekit.io/projectvoyage/Digimons/Datamon_nM4idwN--.gif?ik-sdk-version=javascript-1.4.3&updatedAt=1670347687582"
              style="width: 8%; margin-right: 16px; border-radius: 50%;"
            />
            <div style="display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: 40rem;">
              <h4 style="margin-bottom: 4px;">
                This is the digital barrier safeguarding the real and digital worlds.
              </h4>
              <p>From time to time, exceptionally powerful Digimon venture into this realm, aiming to shatter the barrier and unleash chaos upon our reality. It is now your responsibility to safeguard it with unwavering determination. Stand firm and protect our world to the best of your abilities.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
            
          <div class="worldboss-entry-container">
